) VALUES (
    'history-of-cross-country-skiing',
    '{"en": "History of Cross-Country Skiing: The Original Winter Sport", "de": "Geschichte des Skilanglaufs: Der ursprüngliche Wintersport", "fr": "Histoire du ski de fond : Le sport d''hiver originel", "it": "Storia dello sci di fondo: Lo sport invernale originale", "es": "Historia del esquí de fondo: El deporte de invierno original", "pt": "História do esqui cross-country: O esporte de inverno original", "nl": "Geschiedenis van langlaufen: De originele wintersport", "ar": "تاريخ التزلج الريفي: الرياضة الشتوية الأصلية", "ja": "クロスカントリースキーの歴史：オリジナルのウィンタースポーツ", "zh": "Yueye Huaxue Lishi: Yuanshi de Dongji Yundong", "ko": "크로스컨트리 스키의 역사: 원조 겨울 스포츠"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "Cross-country skiing is humanity''s oldest form of skiing, dating back thousands of years. From survival transportation to endurance racing, it remains the purest test of skiing fitness.", "de": "Skilanglauf ist die älteste Form des Skifahrens und reicht Tausende von Jahren zurück.", "fr": "Le ski de fond est la forme de ski la plus ancienne de l''humanité, remontant à des milliers d''années.", "it": "Lo sci di fondo è la forma più antica di sci dell''umanità, risalente a migliaia di anni fa.", "es": "El esquí de fondo es la forma más antigua de esquí de la humanidad, que se remonta a miles de años.", "pt": "O esqui cross-country é a forma mais antiga de esqui da humanidade, remontando a milhares de anos.", "nl": "Langlaufen is de oudste vorm van skiën, duizenden jaren oud.", "ar": "التزلج الريفي هو أقدم أشكال التزلج للبشرية، ويعود تاريخه إلى آلاف السنين", "ja": "クロスカントリースキーは人類最古のスキー形態で、数千年前に遡ります。", "zh": "Yueye huaxue shi renlei zuigu lao de huaxue xingshi, keyi zhuisu dao shiqian nian qian.", "ko": "크로스컨트리 스키는 수천 년 전으로 거슬러 올라가는 인류 최초의 스키 형태입니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p><a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Cross-country skiing</a> predates all other forms of skiing. Long before athletes raced down alpine slopes, people across northern regions were gliding through forests and across frozen lakes on primitive skis.</p><h2>Ancient Beginnings</h2><p>The oldest known ski, found in Sweden, dates to around 3200 BCE. Rock carvings in Norway from 4000 BCE depict hunters on skis pursuing reindeer. For ancient Scandinavians, skis were essential survival tools, enabling travel, hunting, and communication across vast snowy expanses.</p><p>The word \"ski\" comes from Old Norse \"skíð,\" meaning a piece of split wood. Early skis varied dramatically in design, with some reaching 3 meters in length.</p><h2>Norwegian Traditions</h2><p>Norway is the spiritual home of cross-country skiing. The legendary Birkebeiner race commemorates a 1206 journey when two Birkebeiner warriors carried infant prince Haakon across the mountains on skis, saving the future king from rival factions.</p><p>The first recorded ski race took place in Norway in 1843. By the mid-1800s, ski clubs were forming, and organized competitions were becoming regular events.</p><h2>Techniques Develop</h2><p>Early cross-country skiing used a single technique: the diagonal stride, where arms and legs work in opposition like walking. This classic technique remains central to the sport.</p><p>In 1985, everything changed when skate skiing emerged. Athletes began pushing laterally like ice skaters, achieving dramatically faster speeds. This sparked debates about tradition versus innovation that continue today.</p><h2>World Championship and World Cup</h2><p>The first FIS Nordic World Ski Championships were held in 1925. The World Cup circuit, launched in 1981, created season-long competitions that elevated the sport''s profile internationally.</p><p>Venues like <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a>, <a href=\"/val-di-fiemme-venue-guide/\">Val di Fiemme</a>, and <a href=\"/livigno-venue-guide/\">Livigno</a> became temples of the sport.</p><h2>Great Champions</h2><p>Norway''s Bjørn Dæhlie won eight gold medals across the 1990s, establishing new standards of excellence. Sweden''s Gunde Svan and Russia''s Lyubov Yegorova became legends. Modern stars like <a href=\"/johannes-klaebo-profile/\">Johannes Høsflot Klæbo</a>, <a href=\"/therese-johaug-profile/\">Therese Johaug</a>, and <a href=\"/jessie-diggins-profile/\">Jessie Diggins</a> continue this tradition of athletic excellence.</p><h2>Tour de Ski</h2><p>The Tour de Ski, launched in 2006, created a multi-stage event modeled on cycling''s grand tours. Athletes race across multiple venues, with the famous Alpe Cermis climb providing a dramatic finale.</p><h2>Modern Racing</h2><p>Today''s World Cup features interval start races, mass starts, sprints, and team relays. Distances range from sprint events under 2 km to 50 km marathons. Athletes must master both classic and skating techniques to compete for overall titles.</p><p>From ancient survival to modern sport, cross-country skiing remains the purest test of human endurance on snow.</p>", "de": "<p><a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Skilanglauf</a> ist älter als alle anderen Formen des Skifahrens. Lange bevor Athleten alpine Hänge hinunterfuhren, glitten Menschen durch Wälder und über gefrorene Seen.</p><h2>Antike Anfänge</h2><p>Der älteste bekannte Ski, gefunden in Schweden, stammt aus etwa 3200 v. Chr. Felsmalereien in Norwegen zeigen Jäger auf Skiern.</p><h2>Norwegische Traditionen</h2><p>Norwegen ist die spirituelle Heimat des Skilanglaufs.</p><h2>Große Champions</h2><p>Moderne Stars wie <a href=\"/johannes-klaebo-profile/\">Johannes Høsflot Klæbo</a>, <a href=\"/therese-johaug-profile/\">Therese Johaug</a> und <a href=\"/jessie-diggins-profile/\">Jessie Diggins</a> setzen diese Tradition fort.</p>", "fr": "<p>Le <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">ski de fond</a> est antérieur à toutes les autres formes de ski. Bien avant que les athlètes ne descendent les pentes alpines, les gens glissaient à travers les forêts.</p><h2>Débuts anciens</h2><p>Le plus ancien ski connu, trouvé en Suède, date d''environ 3200 avant J.-C.</p><h2>Traditions norvégiennes</h2><p>La Norvège est le berceau spirituel du ski de fond.</p><h2>Grands champions</h2><p>Des stars modernes comme <a href=\"/johannes-klaebo-profile/\">Johannes Høsflot Klæbo</a> et <a href=\"/therese-johaug-profile/\">Therese Johaug</a> perpétuent cette tradition.</p>", "it": "<p>Lo <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">sci di fondo</a> precede tutte le altre forme di sci. Molto prima che gli atleti gareggiassero sulle piste alpine, le persone scivolavano attraverso le foreste.</p><h2>Inizi antichi</h2><p>Lo sci più antico conosciuto, trovato in Svezia, risale a circa 3200 a.C.</p><h2>Tradizioni norvegesi</h2><p>La Norvegia è la patria spirituale dello sci di fondo.</p><h2>Grandi campioni</h2><p>Star moderne come <a href=\"/johannes-klaebo-profile/\">Johannes Høsflot Klæbo</a> e <a href=\"/therese-johaug-profile/\">Therese Johaug</a> continuano questa tradizione.</p>", "es": "<p>El <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">esquí de fondo</a> es anterior a todas las demás formas de esquí.</p><h2>Comienzos antiguos</h2><p>El esquí más antiguo conocido, encontrado en Suecia, data de alrededor de 3200 a.C.</p>", "pt": "<p>O <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">esqui cross-country</a> é anterior a todas as outras formas de esqui.</p><h2>Inícios antigos</h2><p>O esqui mais antigo conhecido, encontrado na Suécia, data de cerca de 3200 a.C.</p>", "nl": "<p><a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Langlaufen</a> is ouder dan alle andere vormen van skiën.</p><h2>Oude begin</h2><p>De oudste bekende ski, gevonden in Zweden, dateert van rond 3200 v.Chr.</p>", "ar": "<p><a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">التزلج الريفي</a> يسبق جميع أشكال التزلج الأخرى.</p><h2>البدايات القديمة</h2><p>أقدم زلاجة معروفة، وجدت في السويد، تعود إلى حوالي 3200 قبل الميلاد.</p>", "ja": "<p><a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">クロスカントリースキー</a>は他のすべてのスキー形態よりも先に存在していました。</p><h2>古代の始まり</h2><p>スウェーデンで発見された最古の既知のスキーは、紀元前3200年頃のものです。</p>", "zh": "<p><a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Yueye huaxue</a> xianyu suoyou qita huaxue xingshi.</p><h2>Gudai kaishi</h2><p>Zai Ruidian faxian de zuigu lao de huaxue, niandai wei gongyuanqian 3200 nian zuoyou.</p>", "ko": "<p><a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">크로스컨트리 스키</a>는 다른 모든 스키 형태보다 앞섭니다.</p><h2>고대의 시작</h2><p>스웨덴에서 발견된 가장 오래된 스키는 기원전 3200년경으로 거슬러 올라갑니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'XC',
    '{"en": "History of cross-country skiing - From ancient Scandinavian survival tool to modern endurance racing, discover the oldest form of skiing.", "de": "Geschichte des Skilanglaufs - Vom antiken skandinavischen Überlebenstool zum modernen Ausdauersport.", "fr": "Histoire du ski de fond - De l''outil de survie scandinave ancien aux courses d''endurance modernes.", "it": "Storia dello sci di fondo - Dall''antico strumento di sopravvivenza scandinavo alle moderne gare di resistenza.", "es": "Historia del esquí de fondo - De la herramienta de supervivencia escandinava antigua a las carreras de resistencia modernas.", "pt": "História do esqui cross-country - Da ferramenta de sobrevivência escandinava antiga às corridas de resistência modernas.", "nl": "Geschiedenis van langlaufen - Van oud Scandinavisch overlevingsgereedschap tot moderne duursporten.", "ar": "تاريخ التزلج الريفي - من أداة البقاء الاسكندنافية القديمة إلى سباقات التحمل الحديثة", "ja": "クロスカントリースキーの歴史 - 古代スカンジナビアの生存道具から現代の持久レースまで", "zh": "Yueye huaxue lishi - Cong gudai Sigandinawiya shengcun gongju dao xiandai naili bisai", "ko": "크로스컨트리 스키의 역사 - 고대 스칸디나비아 생존 도구에서 현대 지구력 레이싱까지"}'::jsonb,
